Local Windows patch (massmith): `src/deployment.ts` accepts Windows drive paths (`C:\...`/`C:/...`)
in addition to POSIX absolute paths for `stateDir`. Without this, the plugin refuses to start on
Windows. Test files `tests/deployment.spec.ts` that require POSIX-only paths may behave
differently on Windows (sh scripts). Re-apply hunk after any re-vendor from upstream.
